Some useful and popular items in the game
Health booster. Raises your health to 20000000, however you can only use 10 in a single life. Can be acquired by killing the megadragons on Fantasy Island. Also can be acquired from crossing different challenges.
Wand, a wooden magical stick, able to cast deadly and useful spells. Acquired through the completion of the story mode, also can be bought from the crystal mall.
Aura, an item needed to use the wand. Can be bought from crystal mall, also can be acquired by crossing different challenges.
Fantasy pass, teleports you to fantasy island if your level is above 75. Acquired by killing griffins on Fantasy Island, also can be acquired by crossing the path to Fantasy Island.
Teleporter, is used to quickly teleporting yourself to a map. Can be bought from crystal city.
Speed and jump drinks. Enable you to run really fast and jump really high respectively. Both items can be bought from the misc. stores located in both evermore and crystal mall.
Poison and burn cure. Used to cure yourself from poison or burn. Can be bought from crystal mall.
Gas mask, allows you to breathe underwater. Can be acquired on Fantasy Island.
Air canister. Used to insert air in the gas masks. Can be acquired on Fantasy Island.